WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
Sister Shen Huai was able to enter the public ministry not because of my recommendation.

2
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:06,430
I deliberately went to the public office to express my unwillingness to let her go.

3
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:08,730
Aroused Luyunzhuang's rebellious psychology

4
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:10,530
It's because Luyun Village is trying to disgust me

5
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:13,090
He pushed Sister Shen Huai up forcefully.

6
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:17,220
Why didn't she let the prince find a way to arrange a position for her?

7
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,520
Why bother looking for Lu Jia in such a big way?

8
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,060
Such a mediocre person

9
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:23,100
The prince doesn't like it at all

10
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,790
Prince, forgive me

11
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:32,090
The old lady is taking a nap at the moment

12
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,910
The troubled prince is listening and waiting for the guest.

13
00:00:35,030 --> 00:00:37,470
This hour has long passed the time for ordinary stinginess

14
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:39,010
where is the real rest

15
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:41,310
It was obviously the old lady who was putting on airs on purpose.

16
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,350
I want to give Mr. Shen a show of strength.

17
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:45,150
The old lady did not invite her to come over
